      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} The logs for when this stuff occurred have likely been cleared already. I may need to replicate this issue with a few friends of mine, but the desyncing issues with blocked users has been something that's been persistent for the past few years. It's only now that I've started noticing these issues myself",
